statement:
Enumerate finite \(K_4\)-free fiber-coherence CSPs by:
1. incidence-cycle structure;
2. fiber-domain sizes;
3. constraint relations;
4. message-pruning cores on acyclic components;
5. coherent and incoherent Berge cycles;
6. minimal frustration number.
Classify every inclusion-minimal incoherent system through a prescribed
size, and determine whether every minimal obstruction decomposes into
support-pruning cores, cycle-coherence cores, or a genuinely mixed
third family.
